# 04. Authoritative Source Hierarchy

When two frontend documents appear to disagree, use this hierarchy:

```text
Frozen project architecture
        ↓
Phase 06A–06G explicit decisions
        ↓
Current canonical token/component contracts
        ↓
Page-specific approved decisions
        ↓
Stitch-generated interpretation
```

Stitch output never overrides a frozen architectural decision automatically.

---

# 05. Validation Principle

Every foundation decision must answer:

```text
What is it?
Why does it exist?
Where is it used?
What are its states?
What happens responsively?
What happens accessibly?
What must Stitch not change?
```

If these questions cannot be answered, the foundation is not sufficiently defined.

