# 178. Final Freeze Statement

**Phase 06H — Stitch Foundation Validation is FROZEN as the final pre-Stitch validation gate.**

The foundation is now defined as a controlled system rather than a collection of visual preferences.

The purpose of 06H is to ensure that when page-by-page Stitch work begins:

- the visual identity is already fixed;
- the design tokens are already fixed;
- the components are already defined;
- the shell is already defined;
- behavior is already defined;
- responsive behavior is already defined;
- accessibility is already defined;
- routes are already defined;
- page coverage is already defined;
- AI/async states are already defined;
- Stitch is constrained to visual composition rather than architecture invention.

The next phase is:

# **06I — Page-by-Page Design**

Each page will be handled from the canonical Page ID and route through:

